---
title: East 8 Hold Up
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, vodka]
source: Classic cocktail, number 45 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @vodka{1.5%fl_oz}, @Aperol{0.75%fl_oz}, @pineapple juice{1%fl_oz}, @passion fruit purée{0.5%fl_oz}, @lime juice{0.5%fl_oz} and @simple syrup{0.25%fl_oz}. Shake hard for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled).

> A modern London classic, from the East 8 bar in Hackney.
